    "title": "Wellsboro celebrates Homecoming in school, community - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natalie Kennedy nkennedy@tiogapublishing.com ,\n16 hours ago Wellsboro schools and the community celebrated Homecoming the week of Oct. 12-17. The students dressed in different themes each day, concluding with Green & White Day on Friday. The parade traveled from the high school to downtown Wellsboro where it was greeted by crowds of alumni, family members and local supporters. Read full article",
